2
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:21,800
Northern region calls: mother.

3
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,240
Central region calls: ma.

4
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:28,240
Southern region calls: ma.

5
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:38,620
Northern rural area: u.

6
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:45,080
Similarly, Northern region calls: father.

7
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,950
Southern region calls: ba.

8
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,840
Central region calls: tia.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:02,800
Northern rural area calls: thầy.

10
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:19,330
